                                                "sense_id": "2f7c5177-4c99-341a-b3bd-e36865bc7cf2",
                                                "text": "1607, Antony Brewer (attributed), Lingua, or the Combat of the Five Senses for Superiority\nNay, if you begin to critic once, we shall never have done."
                                            }
                                        ]
